>Although the formula in the official spoiler holds up to a point, it is
>impossible to carry a load more than 120 without a bag of holding, even and
>especially in the case of a 30th level 25 Str character who should have a
>CC in the 1000's.  Please look into this or try to explain to me that the
>Carrying Capacity really has nothing to do with the amount you can actually
