Here's the problem:  The formulas listed for carrying capacity in the 
current version of the spoilers are correct - for games compiled without
#define HARD.  For games compiled with the HARD option, the formulas will
not hold up.  The next revision of the spoilers should list formulas for
both HARD and non-HARD compilations of nethack.

